[[Open This|Source NAT IP]]

---

Instances with network interfaces will always have an IPv4 Source NAT (SNAT) address. These allow them to communicate with external hosts, but do not allow external hosts to initiate a session with an instance. SNAT assignment will be enhanced in a future release to provide the option between IPv4 and IPv6, or no SNAT address.